# Integer cents

All money in D1 and API payloads is **integer cents**. Do not store or parse dollars as floats.

```ts
// BAD
amount: z.number() // 12.99 dollars

// GOOD
amount: z.number().int() // 1299 cents
```

- Schema columns: `integer("…")` (see `packages/db/src/schema/`).
- Convert at the UI edge (`apps/web/app/lib/decimal-input.ts`), not in handlers.
- Home-currency columns are also cents (`limitAmountHome`, `*HomeCents` SQL helpers).
